1
00:01:18,719 --> 00:01:20,640
Here, have a taste.

2
00:01:21,319 --> 00:01:24,000
Fresh seasonal tea from the mountain behind our sect.

3
00:01:24,439 --> 00:01:25,719
It's nothing like modern Pu'er tea.

4
00:01:26,200 --> 00:01:27,040
Oh, wow!

5
00:01:27,239 --> 00:01:28,239
Hey, Boss Jun,

6
00:01:28,319 --> 00:01:29,599
I didn't expect that even after transmigrating here,

7
00:01:30,280 --> 00:01:32,239
you'd still love tea as much as ever.

8
00:01:32,439 --> 00:01:34,280
Heh, let me try some.

9
00:01:37,760 --> 00:01:38,319
Mmm.

10
00:01:38,760 --> 00:01:41,359
Good tea really has a unique fragrance.

11
00:01:42,480 --> 00:01:42,959
Great tea!

12
00:01:47,200 --> 00:01:48,120
Seriously?

13
00:01:48,159 --> 00:01:48,920
Is she still kneeling?

14
00:01:49,879 --> 00:01:51,040
Yeah. Senior Sister Ningyan said

15
00:01:51,239 --> 00:01:52,439
this is the punishment she deserves.

16
00:01:52,519 --> 00:01:53,640
She refuses to get up no matter what.

17
00:01:53,840 --> 00:01:55,280
She said she'll kneel until sunset.

18
00:01:55,280 --> 00:01:55,840
You two, stop right there!

19
00:01:57,359 --> 00:01:57,920
Sect Leader!

20
00:01:59,239 --> 00:02:01,239
Did you just say Ningyan was punished with kneeling?

21
00:02:01,719 --> 00:02:02,640
Who made her kneel?

22
00:02:03,519 --> 00:02:04,359
She didn't say.

23
00:02:04,840 --> 00:02:06,200
She just told us to stay out of it.

24
00:02:13,280 --> 00:02:14,960
To make Ningyan accept punishment...

25
00:02:15,759 --> 00:02:17,240
other than His Highness Prince Rong,

26
00:02:17,599 --> 00:02:18,840
there's probably no one else.

27
00:02:19,560 --> 00:02:21,240
Gosh, this Prince Rong!

28
00:02:23,360 --> 00:02:25,639
This is our Flowing Cloud Sect's territory after all.

29
00:02:26,120 --> 00:02:27,680
And Ningyan is your daughter!

30
00:02:28,039 --> 00:02:28,719
Can you really stand by?

31
00:02:29,400 --> 00:02:31,120
But he's His Highness Prince Rong!

32
00:02:31,159 --> 00:02:32,800
The entire Yinbei Dynasty belongs to his family!

33
00:02:32,960 --> 00:02:33,879
An old man like me...

34
00:02:34,039 --> 00:02:35,280
Can I afford to offend him?

35
00:02:36,439 --> 00:02:38,879
But Ningyan is still recovering right now.

36
00:02:39,039 --> 00:02:40,840
She can't just keep kneeling like this!

37
00:02:41,319 --> 00:02:42,039
I need to go see Mo...

38
00:02:43,120 --> 00:02:43,840
No, wait.

39
00:02:43,840 --> 00:02:45,520
I should go ask Boss to intercede.

40
00:02:52,199 --> 00:02:54,159
The show begins.

41
00:02:54,319 --> 00:02:57,639
This poison boils one's blood and destroys their sanity.

42
00:02:57,960 --> 00:02:59,520
With Old Man Ye as the catalyst,

43
00:03:00,000 --> 00:03:02,560
let the deadly game of the Love Gu begin.

44
00:03:07,840 --> 00:03:08,319
Man...

45
00:03:08,680 --> 00:03:10,080
Just last night, Boss and I

46
00:03:10,120 --> 00:03:11,879
had a huge fight over Ningyan.

47
00:03:12,240 --> 00:03:13,439
Coming to see her again now...

48
00:03:14,520 --> 00:03:16,080
feels pretty awkward.

49
00:03:18,719 --> 00:03:20,199
Ah, whatever!

50
00:03:23,960 --> 00:03:25,560
Boss, are you there?

51
00:03:33,039 --> 00:03:33,879
Hey!

52
00:03:34,719 --> 00:03:35,560
Boss!

53
00:03:36,439 --> 00:03:37,080
I...

54
00:03:39,759 --> 00:03:40,479
Old Man Ye,

55
00:03:40,919 --> 00:03:42,960
don't you know to knock before entering a girl's room?

56
00:03:43,400 --> 00:03:44,439
You're blaming me?

57
00:03:44,639 --> 00:03:45,520
It's because you're lazy!

58
00:03:45,520 --> 00:03:46,759
Look, the sun is already high in the sky,

59
00:03:46,759 --> 00:03:47,199
and you're still not out of bed.

60
00:03:47,199 --> 00:03:47,840
I...

61
00:03:51,080 --> 00:03:51,800
What is it?

62
00:03:52,000 --> 00:03:54,199
Heh, well, it's like this.

63
00:03:54,439 --> 00:03:57,120
I heard Prince Rong made Ningyan kneel

64
00:03:57,360 --> 00:03:58,800
just because she offended you.

65
00:03:59,120 --> 00:04:00,599
You know what Ningyan's temper is like.

66
00:04:00,759 --> 00:04:01,719
If Prince Rong doesn't order her to stop,

67
00:04:01,719 --> 00:04:03,199
she'll kneel until the time is fully up.

68
00:04:03,680 --> 00:04:04,800
Prince Rong's cold...

69
00:04:04,800 --> 00:04:06,639
you know his aloof temper.

70
00:04:06,719 --> 00:04:08,439
I don't dare go plead with him myself.

71
00:04:08,439 --> 00:04:09,240
So...

72
00:04:09,240 --> 00:04:12,240
You want me to beg Mo Yuya for Lu Ningyan?

73
00:04:12,240 --> 00:04:14,479
Hehe, exactly!

74
00:04:14,479 --> 00:04:17,000
Boss, I was out of line last night.

75
00:04:17,199 --> 00:04:19,199
If Ningyan wronged you in any way,

76
00:04:19,199 --> 00:04:20,800
I apologize on her behalf.

77
00:04:20,879 --> 00:04:22,040
I'm truly sorry.

78
00:04:22,199 --> 00:04:24,319
Given her grave injury three years ago,

79
00:04:24,319 --> 00:04:25,560
and is still recovering,

80
00:04:25,560 --> 00:04:26,959
plus her constitution is still weak...

81
00:04:26,959 --> 00:04:27,439
Could you just...

82
00:04:27,439 --> 00:04:28,439
Old Man Ye,

83
00:04:29,120 --> 00:04:30,439
it's not that I won't help you,

84
00:04:30,680 --> 00:04:32,319
but I really can't plead for her.

85
00:04:33,000 --> 00:04:33,639
Mo Yuya...

86
00:04:33,639 --> 00:04:35,879
punished Lu Ningyan yesterday for my sake.

87
00:04:36,279 --> 00:04:37,879
Mo Yuya didn't betray my trust;

88
00:04:38,079 --> 00:04:39,360
instead, he chose to defend me.

89
00:04:39,800 --> 00:04:43,519
I can't play the self-righteous hypocrite

90
00:04:43,800 --> 00:04:44,920
and let her off easy.

91
00:04:45,319 --> 00:04:46,560
You get what I mean?

92
00:04:47,360 --> 00:04:48,920
Yeah, that's true.

93
00:04:50,959 --> 00:04:53,519
Then I'll go beg Prince Rong myself.

94
00:04:54,399 --> 00:04:55,160
Wait.

95
00:04:57,680 --> 00:04:58,720
Old Man Ye,

96
00:05:00,199 --> 00:05:01,680
I never imagined

97
00:05:02,199 --> 00:05:03,759
you'd turn into a Doting dad.

98
00:05:04,319 --> 00:05:05,319
Tell me about it.

99
00:05:05,519 --> 00:05:07,360
Ever since I got this body's memories back,

100
00:05:07,360 --> 00:05:08,480
I can't even tell anymore

101
00:05:08,480 --> 00:05:09,959
if I'm more like Old Man Ye,

102
00:05:09,959 --> 00:05:12,120
or the Flowing Cloud Sect Master.

103
00:05:12,160 --> 00:05:13,680
Sigh, but there's one thing I know for sure:

104
00:05:14,040 --> 00:05:15,360
ever since having this daughter,

105
00:05:15,600 --> 00:05:18,920
I feel my life has been so fulfilling and happy.

106
00:05:19,399 --> 00:05:20,000
Really?

107
00:05:20,000 --> 00:05:20,839
Really.

108
00:05:23,519 --> 00:05:26,360
I heard Prince Rong said that once this ends,

109
00:05:26,600 --> 00:05:27,560
he's taking Ningyan away.

110
00:05:28,560 --> 00:05:30,800
I know I've failed Ningyan for years,

111
00:05:31,360 --> 00:05:33,079
and I have no right to keep her with me.

112
00:05:33,759 --> 00:05:36,079
Once that happens,

113
00:05:36,399 --> 00:05:40,079
I'll earn her acceptance as her father.

114
00:05:42,480 --> 00:05:43,480
That's wonderful.

115
00:05:44,199 --> 00:05:46,240
In this world, the two of us...

116
00:05:47,000 --> 00:05:48,959
one found family,

117
00:05:49,240 --> 00:05:50,160
and the other found love.

118
00:05:51,199 --> 00:05:52,639
I was out of line yesterday too,

119
00:05:52,920 --> 00:05:53,800
so I apologize to you as well.

120
00:05:54,480 --> 00:05:56,199
I sincerely hope

121
00:05:56,959 --> 00:05:59,759
you get the outcome you want,

122
00:06:00,879 --> 00:06:02,199
live in Flowing Cloud Sect

123
00:06:03,199 --> 00:06:05,600
and spend your old age with loved ones.

124
00:06:08,920 --> 00:06:11,240
Boss, say no more.

125
00:06:12,120 --> 00:06:13,560
The highest salute of the Jianghu,

126
00:06:14,560 --> 00:06:15,519
I salute you!

127
00:06:27,000 --> 00:06:29,199
Whew, Old Man Ye really scared me.

128
00:06:29,600 --> 00:06:31,759
He almost found his birthday gift.

129
00:06:38,519 --> 00:06:40,079
Elder Ye, is something the matter?

130
00:06:41,920 --> 00:06:43,439
Ah, Prince Rong.

131
00:06:43,600 --> 00:06:46,240
I heard you made Ningyan kneel in punishment last night.

132
00:06:46,560 --> 00:06:47,759
Could you show some leniency

133
00:06:48,160 --> 00:06:49,399
and end her punishment?

134
00:06:50,439 --> 00:06:51,000
You see, here's the thing.

135
00:06:51,319 --> 00:06:54,639
Ningyan was your female guard for years,

136
00:06:54,839 --> 00:06:56,720
but she's a member of the Flowing Cloud Sect now.

137
00:06:56,839 --> 00:06:58,079
She's my daughter. Ye Yuntian's daughter.

138
00:06:58,240 --> 00:06:59,120
The daughter of the Sect Leader.

139
00:06:59,480 --> 00:07:00,439
Being this harsh on her...

140
00:07:01,279 --> 00:07:04,040
isn't it a slight to Flowing Cloud Sect?

141
00:07:04,319 --> 00:07:05,399
It's hardly appropriate.

142
00:07:08,000 --> 00:07:08,519
Elder Ye.

143
00:07:10,120 --> 00:07:10,800
Ningyan...

144
00:07:10,800 --> 00:07:12,720
Since she chose to be my guard,

145
00:07:13,560 --> 00:07:16,439
her fate is entirely up to me.

146
00:07:17,120 --> 00:07:19,720
A mistake warrants punishment.

147
00:07:20,519 --> 00:07:20,959
You...

148
00:07:21,560 --> 00:07:23,000
But she's my daughter!

149
00:07:24,480 --> 00:07:25,560
You fathered her, but never raised her.

150
00:07:26,199 --> 00:07:27,240
Ningyan stated long ago

151
00:07:27,839 --> 00:07:30,639
she won't stay here as your daughter.

152
00:07:31,560 --> 00:07:32,959
I have matters to attend to.

153
00:07:33,879 --> 00:07:34,519
See yourself out.

154
00:07:35,800 --> 00:07:36,879
Mo Yuya!

155
00:07:37,160 --> 00:07:38,600
Don't push your luck!

156
00:07:38,600 --> 00:07:39,560
What did you say?

157
00:07:45,240 --> 00:07:47,439
I said you brat,

158
00:07:47,720 --> 00:07:50,160
don't Give an inch and take a mile!

159
00:07:54,680 --> 00:07:57,120
Don't think being born into royalty

160
00:07:57,279 --> 00:08:00,199
means you can put on royal airs anytime!

161
00:08:00,519 --> 00:08:01,639
With your attitude,

162
00:08:01,800 --> 00:08:04,040
I won't let Ningyan follow you,

163
00:08:04,240 --> 00:08:06,079
a tyrant like you,

164
00:08:06,120 --> 00:08:08,319
to suffer by your side!

165
00:08:08,720 --> 00:08:09,959
Oh!

166
00:08:11,399 --> 00:08:12,120
Weiyue!

167
00:08:12,600 --> 00:08:13,920
If you hadn't reminded me,

168
00:08:14,000 --> 00:08:14,920
I would've completely forgotten

169
00:08:15,160 --> 00:08:16,560
that for staff birthdays every year,

170
00:08:16,959 --> 00:08:18,079
we need to prepare gifts for them!

171
00:08:19,120 --> 00:08:20,600
Today is Old Man Ye's birthday.

172
00:08:21,160 --> 00:08:22,319
How come you remember it so well?

173
00:08:22,759 --> 00:08:25,360
He throws a party for me every year!

174
00:08:25,759 --> 00:08:27,759
All right, all done!

175
00:08:28,560 --> 00:08:29,079
Let's go.

176
00:08:29,360 --> 00:08:30,199
Let's go find Old Man Ye!

177
00:08:30,639 --> 00:08:31,759
Disaster! Senior Brother, Senior Sister!

178
00:08:32,200 --> 00:08:33,039
What happened?

179
00:08:34,399 --> 00:08:36,360
Mo Yuya killed Sect Leader Ye!

180
00:08:40,039 --> 00:08:40,840
Old Man Ye!

181
00:08:54,639 --> 00:08:55,960
This cake is so sweet.

182
00:08:57,039 --> 00:09:00,679
Yet Old Ye will never get to taste it.

183
00:09:01,120 --> 00:09:02,120
Old Man Ye...

184
00:09:03,799 --> 00:09:04,679
Weiyue.

185
00:09:04,799 --> 00:09:05,799
Old Man Ye...

186
00:09:29,320 --> 00:09:30,080
Mo Yuya,

187
00:09:31,919 --> 00:09:33,639
did you kill him or not?!

188
00:09:37,000 --> 00:09:37,799
I...

189
00:09:39,879 --> 00:09:40,840
Ah!

190
00:09:50,639 --> 00:09:51,360
Old Man Ye!

191
00:09:59,399 --> 00:10:00,200
Father!

192
00:10:07,240 --> 00:10:09,759
I only struck him with a light palm earlier...

193
00:10:09,879 --> 00:10:10,240
And then...

194
00:10:10,240 --> 00:10:11,039
A light palm strike?!

195
00:10:11,919 --> 00:10:13,080
Do you honestly believe your own words?

196
00:10:13,799 --> 00:10:16,279
Your light palm killed him in one blow?!

197
00:10:17,960 --> 00:10:18,840
Mo Yuya!

198
00:10:20,879 --> 00:10:22,720
Why on earth did you do this?!

199
00:10:23,000 --> 00:10:25,120
Old Man Ye... how did he ever offend you?!

200
00:10:27,159 --> 00:10:28,039
This has nothing to do with Master!

201
00:10:28,360 --> 00:10:29,360
If you want to blame someone, take it out on me!

202
00:10:29,480 --> 00:10:30,559
Take it out on you?

203
00:10:32,159 --> 00:10:33,120
So it is your business then?

204
00:10:33,960 --> 00:10:34,799
What,

205
00:10:35,320 --> 00:10:37,399
did the two of you team up to murder Old Man Ye?!

206
00:10:37,519 --> 00:10:37,919
No!

207
00:10:42,639 --> 00:10:43,279
Before this,

208
00:10:44,840 --> 00:10:46,840
Ye Yuntian forced me to stay in the sect.

209
00:10:47,360 --> 00:10:48,519
It was my own choice to refuse!

210
00:10:49,000 --> 00:10:50,720
Who knew that as sect master,

211
00:10:51,000 --> 00:10:53,000
he'd take his anger out on Master instead?

212
00:10:53,840 --> 00:10:55,080
He even presumptuously

213
00:10:55,399 --> 00:10:57,159
ran over to protest my punishment!

214
00:10:57,960 --> 00:11:00,480
He clashed with Master and went straight for the kill!

215
00:11:00,480 --> 00:11:01,279
You're lying!

216
00:11:02,320 --> 00:11:03,639
Old Man Ye would never do that!

217
00:11:04,279 --> 00:11:06,279
And Master doesn't kill indiscriminately!

218
00:11:17,200 --> 00:11:18,080
A man like him,

219
00:11:19,440 --> 00:11:21,120
fathered me yet never raised me,

220
00:11:21,919 --> 00:11:23,159
and now he expects me to stay

221
00:11:23,159 --> 00:11:24,000
to care for him in his old age?

222
00:11:25,440 --> 00:11:27,360
He's selfish to the core!

223
00:11:33,159 --> 00:11:33,919
Lu Ningyan!

224
00:11:36,440 --> 00:11:38,639
How could you utter such vile words?

225
00:11:40,440 --> 00:11:43,120
Ever since Old Man Ye found out about you,

226
00:11:43,919 --> 00:11:46,399
he cast aside our nearly ten-year friendship

227
00:11:46,399 --> 00:11:47,320
and disregarded my wedding

228
00:11:47,320 --> 00:11:48,600
to rush back to Flowing Cloud Sect!

229
00:11:51,279 --> 00:11:52,519
In his heart and mind,

230
00:11:52,519 --> 00:11:53,919
you were all that mattered!

231
00:11:55,679 --> 00:11:57,200
How dare you speak of him like that!

232
00:12:09,080 --> 00:12:10,120
Because of you,

233
00:12:11,159 --> 00:12:12,320
Old Ye is dead.

234
00:12:15,639 --> 00:12:18,879
He died on his supposed 60th birthday.

235
00:12:22,559 --> 00:12:23,639
In his entire life,

236
00:12:25,519 --> 00:12:27,200
he had no children.

237
00:12:49,639 --> 00:12:50,759
Senior Brother, do you know?

238
00:12:53,120 --> 00:12:54,480
I promised him back then

239
00:12:55,720 --> 00:12:58,159
to help Old Man Ye get rich in this era

240
00:12:59,559 --> 00:13:00,799
and live out his days in peace.

241
00:13:03,120 --> 00:13:05,360
But why did he die so suddenly?

242
00:13:06,480 --> 00:13:08,519
He didn't even get a bite of cake.

243
00:13:11,120 --> 00:13:14,559
He'll surely eat it in the afterlife.

244
00:13:17,480 --> 00:13:19,519
Old Man Ye's life was so tragic.

245
00:13:21,320 --> 00:13:23,039
Just two days ago, he told me

246
00:13:24,279 --> 00:13:26,320
that his biggest wish in life

247
00:13:27,200 --> 00:13:29,279
was to do right by his daughter,

248
00:13:31,480 --> 00:13:36,080
to make up for a debt he didn't owe.

249
00:13:38,799 --> 00:13:41,159
But what did he ever do wrong?

250
00:13:41,759 --> 00:13:43,440
Why would heaven be so cruel to him?

251
00:13:45,600 --> 00:13:49,360
Maybe it's because Lu Ningyan didn't know

252
00:13:49,519 --> 00:13:51,919
that Old Man Ye wasn't her real father,

253
00:13:52,799 --> 00:13:55,279
yet he gave her all his fatherly love.

254
00:13:55,279 --> 00:13:56,279
Even so, I still hate her.

255
00:13:57,000 --> 00:13:58,240
If it weren't for her,

256
00:13:58,600 --> 00:14:00,399
Old Man Ye wouldn't have faced Mo Yuya...

257
00:14:04,440 --> 00:14:06,080
I wish I could kill her!

258
00:14:08,200 --> 00:14:10,159
She's already died once.

259
00:14:21,120 --> 00:14:21,960
I already told you,

260
00:14:22,519 --> 00:14:25,039
clinging to me will get you killed.

261
00:14:28,840 --> 00:14:31,879
An illusion? Do I want her dead that bad?

262
00:14:32,720 --> 00:14:35,440
Why are these images popping into my head?

263
00:14:37,039 --> 00:14:38,000
What's wrong?

264
00:14:38,559 --> 00:14:39,399
Are you okay?

265
00:14:42,480 --> 00:14:43,559
It's getting late.

266
00:14:43,879 --> 00:14:45,039
Let's head back to the sect first.

267
00:14:45,480 --> 00:14:46,799
We'll come back another day.

268
00:15:03,360 --> 00:15:04,159
Weiyue
